Subject: [PATCH 17/27] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: exynos-sysreg: Add
 Exynos9810 CMGP and PERIC sysregs

Document the system registers of the CMGP, PERIC0 and PERIC1 blocks of
Exynos9810, which hold the SW_CONF registers of the USI blocks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
